s\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Historical release / checkpoint / final diagnostic</p><h2>Retained same-node comparison.</h2><p>Queue100k4\u21924: releasec8d37,528.314 ms, checkpoint7f12,015.063 ms, finalc1411,455.302 ms;69.48% lower versus release. Scheduling median+8.70% versus release has overlapping ranges. Three samples per version are descriptive, not a significance test or a replacement for current peer results.</p></section>"}
